  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid tightening of export controls on critical technologies creates immediate supply‑chain uncertainty and regulatory risk that forces large, cross‑sector repricings across equities, FX, bonds and commodities, driving up realized and implied volatility.</data>
