  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Frequent attacks on tankers, terminals or refineries generate sustained international news coverage of Gulf instability and its regional implications, which increases media attention and salience of nearby flashpoints including settlement-related disputes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_palestine_flashpo</data>
