  <data key="d28">1</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp, sustained oil-price spikes driven by Gulf tensions raise political and strategic sensitivity among energy-importing states and publics, elevating their perception that regional crises (including Israel–Palestine) could trigger further destabilizing shocks.</data>
