  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharper, broader sanctions raise compliance costs and counterparty risk for banks and insurers with exposure to affected states and trading partners, prompting immediate re-pricing of sovereign exposure and wider credit spreads for those sovereigns.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">israel_palestine_flashpo</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_turmoil</data>
</edge>
