  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Expanded and harsher sanctions raise compliance costs and insurance premiums for shippers and traders, prompting carriers to avoid risky routes or suspend transits through strategic chokepoints, reducing volume.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">israel_palestine_flashpo</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
