  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">An increased perceived probability of regional military escalation triggers fast portfolio rebalancing across equities, bonds, FX and commodities (including option hedging), driving realized and implied volatility higher across asset classes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-3 months</data>
