  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising perceived risk of wider regional escalation in the Israel–Palestine flashpoint motivates major mediators (US, EU, UN) to increase envoy activity across multiple theaters, including stepped-up mediation efforts around Russia–Ukraine, to prevent simultaneous crises.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
