  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher perceived probability of broader escalation hardens domestic political postures and threat perceptions among principals and their constituencies, reducing leaders' readiness in Kyiv or Moscow to accept compromises or enter talks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">israel_palestine_flashpo</data>
