  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained rises in long‑term government yields in major donor states raise borrowing costs and domestic budgetary strain, reducing political appetite for prolonged external military financing and pushing affected parties toward greater readiness to negotiate.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
