  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising long‑term government yields increase corporate discount rates and borrowing costs, directly reducing the net present value and financing feasibility of long‑lived fab investments, lowering investment flows into semiconductors.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_financial_turmoil</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
