  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Widening sovereign spreads raise country risk premia and the cost/availability of project and export financing, prompting firms and banks to postpone or scale back capital‑intensive semiconductor capex projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_financial_turmoil</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
