  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in cross-asset volatility raise perceived near-term supply/demand and counterparty risks among traders and refiners, prompting market participants and funds to price an additional supply-disruption premium into oil contracts.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
